  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A long-wearing baked blush that’s non-comedogenic and lightweight for a diffused flush of color.<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Plant-Derived Squalane and Glycerin: Help moisturize and soften dry skin.<br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Locks in moisture to hydrate skin.<br>- Ethically Sourced Silica and Mica: Helps to blur skin with a natural, diffused finish.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b> With a light hand, DIP flat side of Powder Blush Brush into SuperSuede&trade;. <br>-Gently TAP off excess pigment from bristles for a controlled, even application.<br>-Softly SWEEP brush over apples of the cheeks and up toward the temples. Repeat to build pigment. - Stack SuperSuede&trade; on top of Dew Blush Liquid Cream Blush (sold separately) to intensify color and set.<br><br>-SaieGlow&trade; Pro Artist Tip: <br>- Use one side of the Powder Blush Brush's bristles to apply pigment and the opposite clean side to blend.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><div>MA DONNA, BELLA, GRAZIE, CIAO</div><p>MICA, SYNTHETIC FLUORPHLOGOPITE, KAOLIN, SQUALANE, JOJOBA ESTERS, OCTYLDODECANOL, HECTORITE, SILICA, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, POTASSIUM SORBATE, ALUMINA, BORON NITRIDE, CELLULOSE, TIN OXIDE, GLYCERIN, SODIUM ACETYLATED HYALURONATE, AQUA / WATER / EAU, TOCOPHEROL, GLYCYRRHIZA GLABRA (LICORICE) ROOT EXTRACT, SODIUM BENZOATE. &nbsp;[+/- MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR: &nbsp;TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), BISMUTH OXYCHLORIDE (CI 77163), ULTRAMARINES (CI 77007), RED 7 (CI 15850), RED 7 LAKE (CI 15850), RED 22 LAKE (CI 45380), RED 28 LAKE (CI 45410)].</p><div><br></div><p><br></p><div>VINO, FRUTTI, AMORE, MIA, STELLA</div><p>MICA, SYNTHETIC FLUORPHLOGOPITE, KAOLIN, SQUALANE, JOJOBA ESTERS, OCTYLDODECANOL, HECTORITE, SILICA, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, POTASSIUM SORBATE, ALUMINA, BORON NITRIDE, CELLULOSE, GLYCERIN, SODIUM ACETYLATED HYALURONATE, AQUA / WATER / EAU, TOCOPHEROL, GLYCYRRHIZA GLABRA (LICORICE) ROOT EXTRACT, SODIUM BENZOATE. &nbsp;[+/- MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR: &nbsp;TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), BISMUTH OXYCHLORIDE (CI 77163), ULTRAMARINES (CI 77007), RED 7 (CI 15850), RED 7 LAKE (CI 15850), RED 28 LAKE (CI 45410)].</p><p><br></p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A long-wearing baked blush that’s non-comedogenic and lightweight for a diffused flush of color.<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Plant-Derived Squalane and Glycerin: Help moisturize and soften dry skin.<br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Locks in moisture to hydrate skin.<br>- Ethically Sourced Silica and Mica: Helps to blur skin with a natural, diffused finish.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes